<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Don't Grow Up Too Fast</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">grentperez</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Don't Grow Up Too Fast</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1moE3Qvo70cpkGT6RcRy9l</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.272" end="00:16.287">You’re getting on a plane and leaving</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.287" end="00:23.686">I hope you’re staying not too far</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.686" end="00:30.324">Coz all those dreams I had were real ones</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.324" end="00:34.058">But something got in the way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.058" end="00:37.751">Time it just couldn’t wait, so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.751" end="00:39.251" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.907" end="00:44.338">Don’t grow up too fast</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.338" end="00:51.567">Don’t leave me in the past</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.567" end="00:58.847">As long as you never change who you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.847" end="01:02.028">Ill know that in your heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.028" end="01:05.438">You’re never far</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.438" end="01:09.405">Oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.405" end="01:14.763" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.763" end="01:21.869">Got so caught up in ‘all the used to be’s’</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.869" end="01:29.014">Forgot to look into the now’s</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.014" end="01:31.758">I’m proud of you I’ll say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.758" end="01:36.056">Though I’m still stuck in childish ways</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.056" end="01:38.378">Those memories that we made</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.378" end="01:43.056">I know they play in your brain, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.056" end="01:44.556" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.212" end="01:49.059">Don’t grow up too fast</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.059" end="01:56.061">Don’t leave me in the past</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.061" end="02:02.956">As long as you never change who you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.956" end="02:06.139">I’ll know that in your heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.139" end="02:09.771">You’re never far</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.771" end="02:11.271" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.914" end="02:14.020">I guess I thought there’d be more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.020" end="02:16.494">Time for us to spend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.494" end="02:19.929">Just like how it used to be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.929" end="02:25.310">Turning moments to history</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.310" end="02:30.459">But there I go again reminiscing Far too much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.459" end="02:33.935">It’s time I move on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.935" end="02:38.639">Just know my love will stay strong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.639" end="02:40.139" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.439" end="02:47.439">Don’t grow up too fast</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.685" end="02:54.651">Don’t leave me in the past</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.651" end="03:01.779">As long as you never change who you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.779" end="03:05.467">I’ll know that in your heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.467" end="03:09.372">I’ll know that in your heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.372" end="03:15.994">Don’t grow up too fast</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.994" end="03:22.996">Don’t leave me in the past</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.996" end="03:25.761">Coz times will change but</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:25.761" end="03:30.574">That don’t mean you have to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:30.574" end="03:36.264">I cant grow up without</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:36.264" end="03:43.701">Oh, I cant grow up without</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:43.701" end="03:47.701">You</p></div></body></tt>